      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;why&#34;&gt;Why?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;It was a life long dream to create a plane and although you can make a glider with cheap foam board and hot glue. Controlling it was a different challenge. The cheapest available RC controller locally available to me would have cost &lt;strong&gt;no&lt;/strong&gt; less than 100 USD.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I spent most of my childhood dreaming of the day I can watch my own aircraft soar while obsessing over channels such as Flitetest.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
